---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Portfolio Legal & Político | Desarrollo Web Premium">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section id="inicio" class="relative overflow-hidden pt-20 pb-24 md:pt-32 md:pb-36 flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 md:px-8 text-center relative z-10">
      
      <!-- Premium Badge -->
      <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 rounded-full border border-brand-gold/30 bg-brand-gold/5 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-brand-gold backdrop-blur-sm mb-6">
        <span class="flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-brand-gold animate-pulse"></span>
        <span>Desarrollo Web & Estrategia Digital Especializada</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Headline -->
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-7xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
        Presencia Digital de Alto Impacto para el
        <span class="block bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-gold via-[#e9c47a] to-brand-gold bg-clip-text text-transparent">
          Sector Legal y Político
        </span>
      </h1>

      <!-- Description -->
      <p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-base md:text-xl text-slate-400 mb-10 leading-relaxed">
        Diseño y desarrollo de sitios web institucionales, plataformas para conferencias y landing pages para campañas electorales. Soluciones de alto rendimiento que proyectan confianza y seriedad.
      </p>

      <!-- CTA Buttons -->
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="#proyectos" id="hero-btn-primary" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold text-brand-slate bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-gold to-[#e9c47a] hover:opacity-90 shadow-lg shadow-brand-gold/10 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 text-center">
          Ver Casos de Éxito
        </a>
        <a href="#registro" id="hero-btn-secondary" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold text-slate-300 hover:text-white bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 border border-white/15 hover:border-white/20 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 text-center">
          Cotizar Proyecto
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Servicios Section -->
  <section id="servicios" class="py-20 bg-slate-950/40 border-y border-white/5 relative">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-8">
      
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white mb-4">Servicios Especializados</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm md:text-base">Infraestructura y diseño orientados a cumplir las exigencias de formalidad, seguridad y conversión del sector.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        
        <!-- Law Firms -->
        <div class="group relative rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-[#0d1322]/40 p-8 hover:bg-[#0d1322]/60 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-brand-gold/20">
          <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-24 h-24 bg-brand-gold/5 rounded-full blur-xl group-hover:bg-brand-gold/10 transition-all duration-300"></div>
          <div class="mb-5 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-gold/10 text-brand-gold group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 6l3 1m0 0l-3 9a5.002 5.002 0 006.001 0M6 7l3 9M6 7l6-2m6 2l3-1m-3 1l-3 9a5.002 5.002 0 006.001 0M18 7l3 9m-3-9l-6-2m0-2v2m0 16V5m0 16H9m3 0h3" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Sitios para Abogados y Firmas</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Diseño corporativo sobrio e institucional para firmas legales. Enfocado en destacar áreas de práctica, trayectoria del equipo y agendar consultas directas de forma segura.
          </p>
          <ul class="text-xs text-slate-500 space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="h-1 w-1 bg-brand-gold rounded-full"></span> Reserva de consultas automatizada</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="h-1 w-1 bg-brand-gold rounded-full"></span> Directorio de socios y especialidades</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="h-1 w-1 bg-brand-gold rounded-full"></span> Diseño responsivo e impecable</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Conferences & Events -->
        <div class="group relative rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-[#0d1322]/40 p-8 hover:bg-[#0d1322]/60 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-brand-gold/20">
          <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-24 h-24 bg-brand-gold/5 rounded-full blur-xl group-hover:bg-brand-gold/10 transition-all duration-300"></div>
          <div class="mb-5 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-gold/10 text-brand-gold group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Eventos, Congresos & Conferencias</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Sitios web dinámicos diseñados específicamente para seminarios, congresos jurídicos y convenciones políticas. Carga rápida para registro masivo de asistentes.
          </p>
          <ul class="text-xs text-slate-500 space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="h-1 w-1 bg-brand-gold rounded-full"></span> Agenda interactiva y cronogramas</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="h-1 w-1 bg-brand-gold rounded-full"></span> Registro de participantes integrado</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="h-1 w-1 bg-brand-gold rounded-full"></span> Perfil de expositores y descargas</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Campaigns & Landing Pages -->
        <div class="group relative rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-[#0d1322]/40 p-8 hover:bg-[#0d1322]/60 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-brand-gold/20">
          <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-24 h-24 bg-brand-gold/5 rounded-full blur-xl group-hover:bg-brand-gold/10 transition-all duration-300"></div>
          <div class="mb-5 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-gold/10 text-brand-gold group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M11 5.882V19.24a1.76 1.76 0 01-3.417.592l-2.147-6.15M18 13a3 3 0 100-6M5.436 13.683A4.001 4.001 0 017 6h1.832c4.1 0 7.625-1.234 9.168-3v14c-1.543-1.766-5.067-3-9.168-3H7a3.988 3.988 0 01-1.564-.317z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Campañas Políticas y Publicidad</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Páginas de aterrizaje (landings) de alto rendimiento para candidaturas, propuestas legislativas o iniciativas públicas. Optimizadas para captar firmas y voluntarios.
          </p>
          <ul class="text-xs text-slate-500 space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="h-1 w-1 bg-brand-gold rounded-full"></span> Alta velocidad y optimización SEO móvil</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="h-1 w-1 bg-brand-gold rounded-full"></span> Captación de base de datos (Firestore ready)</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="h-1 w-1 bg-brand-gold rounded-full"></span> Galería de prensa y comunicados</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Proyectos Section -->
  <section id="proyectos" class="py-20 relative">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-8">
      
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white mb-4">Proyectos y Casos</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm md:text-base">Muestra de trabajos especializados listos para producción.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        
        <!-- Project 1: Legal Conference -->
        <div class="group relative rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-[#0c111e]/60 overflow-hidden hover:border-brand-gold/20 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="h-48 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-navy via-[#0d1222] to-brand-slate flex items-center justify-center p-6 border-b border-white/5 relative">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-brand-gold/10 via-transparent to-transparent opacity-60"></div>
            <div class="relative text-center">
              <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-brand-gold uppercase">Conferencia Jurídica</span>
              <p class="text-lg font-bold text-white mt-1">Cumbre de Derecho 2026</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="flex gap-2 mb-4">
              <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-medium bg-slate-800 text-slate-300">Astro</span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-medium bg-slate-800 text-slate-300">Vite / Tailwind</span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-medium bg-slate-800 text-slate-300">Firestore</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-6">
              Sitio web oficial del evento legislativo anual. Incluye cronograma modular de ponencias, perfiles de los ponentes y pasarela de inscripción de asistentes.
            </p>
            <a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center text-xs font-semibold text-brand-gold hover:text-brand-gold-hover transition-colors">
              Ver Proyecto Demo
              <svg class="ml-2 w-3.5 h-3.5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Project 2: Law Firm website -->
        <div class="group relative rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-[#0c111e]/60 overflow-hidden hover:border-brand-gold/20 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="h-48 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-navy via-[#0d1222] to-brand-slate flex items-center justify-center p-6 border-b border-white/5 relative">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-brand-gold/10 via-transparent to-transparent opacity-60"></div>
            <div class="relative text-center">
              <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-brand-gold uppercase">Firma de Abogados</span>
              <p class="text-lg font-bold text-white mt-1">Valenzuela & Asociados</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="flex gap-2 mb-4">
              <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-medium bg-slate-800 text-slate-300">Astro</span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-medium bg-slate-800 text-slate-300">Tailwind CSS</span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-medium bg-slate-800 text-slate-300">React Scheduler</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-6">
              Plataforma web para una firma boutique especializada en derecho comercial. Integra un sistema interactivo de agendamiento y sección de consultas.
            </p>
            <a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center text-xs font-semibold text-brand-gold hover:text-brand-gold-hover transition-colors">
              Ver Proyecto Demo
              <svg class="ml-2 w-3.5 h-3.5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Project 3: Campaign website -->
        <div class="group relative rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-[#0c111e]/60 overflow-hidden hover:border-brand-gold/20 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="h-48 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-navy via-[#0d1222] to-brand-slate flex items-center justify-center p-6 border-b border-white/5 relative">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-brand-gold/10 via-transparent to-transparent opacity-60"></div>
            <div class="relative text-center">
              <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-brand-gold uppercase">Iniciativa Social</span>
              <p class="text-lg font-bold text-white mt-1">Democracia Transparente</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="flex gap-2 mb-4">
              <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-medium bg-slate-800 text-slate-300">Astro</span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-medium bg-slate-800 text-slate-300">Tailwind CSS</span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-medium bg-slate-800 text-slate-300">Auth & Storage</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-6">
              Portal informativo de candidatura política. Integra registro de voluntarios, descargas de programas electorales y sistema para recolección de firmas.
            </p>
            <a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center text-xs font-semibold text-brand-gold hover:text-brand-gold-hover transition-colors">
              Ver Proyecto Demo
              <svg class="ml-2 w-3.5 h-3.5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contacto / Event Registration -->
  <section id="registro" class="py-20 bg-slate-950/20 border-t border-white/5 relative">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 md:px-8">
      
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white mb-4">Iniciar Consulta de Desarrollo</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">
          ¿Tienes una conferencia o campaña en puerta? Elige el canal que te resulte más cómodo para comunicarte.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 3-Channel Grid Selector -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        
        <!-- Option 1: WhatsApp -->
        <a href="https://wa.me/573024925974?text=Hola%20Nicol%C3%A1s%2C%20vi%20tu%20portafolio%20y%20me%20gustar%C3%ADa%20cotizar%20un%20proyecto." target="_blank" class="group relative rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-[#0d1322]/40 p-6 hover:bg-[#0d1322]/60 hover:border-emerald-500/30 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-emerald-500/5 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-16 h-16 bg-emerald-500/5 rounded-full blur-xl group-hover:bg-emerald-500/10 transition-all duration-300"></div>
          <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L0 24l6.335-1.662c1.746.953 3.71 1.458 5.704 1.459h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-semibold bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 mb-3 animate-pulse">El más rápido</span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">WhatsApp Directo</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">
            Chatea conmigo directamente. Respuesta inmediata en minutos.
          </p>
        </a>

        <!-- Option 2: Email -->
        <button id="btn-email-options" class="group relative rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-[#0d1322]/40 p-6 hover:bg-[#0d1322]/60 hover:border-brand-gold/30 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-brand-gold/5 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col items-center text-center cursor-pointer">
          <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-16 h-16 bg-brand-gold/5 rounded-full blur-xl group-hover:bg-brand-gold/10 transition-all duration-300"></div>
          <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-gold/10 text-brand-gold group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-semibold bg-brand-gold/10 text-brand-gold mb-3">Soporta adjuntos</span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Correo Completo</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">
            Escríbeme por email para adjuntar archivos, PDFs o briefs.
          </p>
        </button>

        <!-- Option 3: Quick Form Toggle -->
        <button id="btn-toggle-form" class="group relative rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-[#0d1322]/40 p-6 hover:bg-[#0d1322]/60 hover:border-blue-500/30 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-blue-500/5 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col items-center text-center cursor-pointer">
          <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-16 h-16 bg-blue-500/5 rounded-full blur-xl group-hover:bg-blue-500/10 transition-all duration-300"></div>
          <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-400 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01M21 12c0 4.418-4.03 8-9 8a9.863 9.863 0 01-4.255-.949L3 20l1.395-3.72C3.512 15.042 3 13.574 3 12c0-4.418 4.03-8 9-8s9 3.582 9 8z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-semibold bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-400 mb-3">Sin salir de la web</span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Mensaje Rápido</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">
            Completa nuestro formulario express de cotización sin archivos.
          </p>
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Collapsible Quick Form Container -->
      <div id="quick-form-container" class="hidden opacity-0 max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out">
        <div class="relative rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0c1220]/80 p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-xl max-w-2xl mx-auto mt-4">
          
          <!-- Warning/Info Alert -->
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-amber-500/20 bg-amber-500/5 p-4 text-xs text-amber-400 mb-6">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-amber-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z" />
            </svg>
            <div>
              <span class="font-bold">Aviso de tiempo de respuesta:</span> Es posible que tardemos un poco más de lo habitual en contestar a través de este medio. Si necesitas una respuesta urgente o deseas adjuntar archivos, te sugerimos utilizar **WhatsApp** o **Correo Completo**.
            </div>
          </div>

          <form id="event-form" class="space-y-6">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
              <div>
                <label for="name" class="block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 mb-2">Nombre / Entidad</label>
                <input type="text" id="name" required class="w-full bg-slate-950/60 border border-white/10 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-white placeholder-slate-600 focus:outline-none focus:border-brand-gold focus:ring-1 focus:ring-brand-gold transition-all text-sm" placeholder="Firma o Candidatura" />
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for="email" class="block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 mb-2">Correo de Contacto</label>
